This is a rogue-like

Goals: 
    Learning C, learning in general
    Simple gameplay, clean code
    Extensible

Features: 
    nCurses for rendering - ascii rendering/graphics
    dungeon generation
    camera follows player
    simple fighting mechanics
Extra (not just gameplay):
    Better debug logger (print should have sense so reading it makes more sense)
    CPU Logger to for resource management

Player
    Line of sight mechanics
    *Random stats generation
    *Leveling
    *Movement and attack

Monsters
    Only a couple
    *Simple A* pathfinding

