    *Forget vs Remebered tiles
        *Only update set_camera_view if camera_position changes
        Right now everything is seen and then remebered (is_visible)
    *Different generation methods
        Implemented simple cellular automata
        *BSD
        *Carving for more of a 'cave feel'
        Save + load floors
            Maybe also save floor's objects

